  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 2102.04 “Neutral” as a noun means an impartial individual who does not represent or support the interests of any of the persons involved in the proceeding, who works with the parties to resolve the dispute. The term includes “neutral evaluator”, “mediator”, and “arbitrator”.\n\nSource. #14331, eff 8-20-25, EXPIRES: 8-20-35",
